      <title>US Shortages of High-End Munitions Are Crisis in the Making</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-15/us-shortages-of-high-end-munitions-are-crisis-in-the-making</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9abd0b192954bf1a6dea999a</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 10:00:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Military analysts have long warned that a conflict with China could consume US stocks of key munitions within days or weeks. That timeline has shrunk even further now that the Department of Defense has burned through a shocking number of its most sophisticated missiles in the war with Iran. The US not only needs to accelerate efforts to replenish those weapons — it ought to rethink their centrality to its warfighting strategy, too.</description>
